# RankOS Frontend — PRODUCTION build-time environment
# Copy to `.env` (or set in your host/CI). VITE_* vars are inlined at BUILD time,
# so they must be present when you run `npm run build`.

# Absolute URL of the deployed backend API, including the /api prefix.
# Example: https://api.yourdomain.com/api
VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api

# Alternative (recommended): leave VITE_API_URL UNSET and serve the API
# same-origin at /api behind a proxy/route. Then the session cookie is
# first-party (SameSite=Lax works) and no CORS is needed. Configure the proxy
# at your edge (e.g. a Cloudflare route /api/* → the backend origin).
